// DUT prototype: single shared data store.
//
// Every space (DNTT officer, company transporter, individual transporter,
// driver app, control agent app) reads and writes the same store, so an
// action in one place is reflected everywhere: a DUT issued by the officer
// shows up in the transporter's "to pay" list, a payment updates the officer
// queue and KPIs, a pairing code generated by the transporter can be typed in
// the driver app, a passage validated by the control agent appears in the
// trip timeline, etc.
//
// State is kept in memory and in localStorage (best effort), so it survives a
// reload. "Réinitialiser les données" restores the seed data.

